DESCRIPTION:Spencer King is known for his sharp wit\, dry delivery\, and ab
 ility to make everyday awkwardness hilarious. Drawing inspiration from his 
 upbringing in a conservative environment\, Spencer’s comedy often walks t
 he line between observational and absurd\, weaving personal stories with un
 expected punchlines. Whether he’s talking about family dynamics\, religio
 us quirks\, or his own social misfires\, Spencer’s material connects with
  audiences who appreciate humor with a bite of truth.\n\nOver the years\, S
 pencer has built a loyal following through performances at comedy clubs acr
 oss the West and appearances at festivals including the Golden Spike Comedy
  Festival.\n\nPlease note: This show contains dark themes\, including discu
 ssions of death\, and features adult language throughout. It’s not for th
 e easily offended or faint of heart—but if you enjoy comedy that’s brut
 ally honest\, and a little twisted\, you’re in the right place. Viewer di
